description:
Implement `structuredClonePolyfill(value)` that deep-clones a value. Support primitives, arrays, plain objects, `Date`, and `null`. Functions are not supported.

**Example:**
```js
const original = { a: [1, 2], d: new Date('2024-01-01') };
const clone = structuredClonePolyfill(original);
clone.a.push(3);
original.a.length; // 2 — unaffected
```

